# Cutline — Cursor is primary

This repo is built for **Cursor**, not GitHub Copilot. Do repo work here. Do **not** tell the user to switch to Copilot unless they explicitly ask.

## Start here

| Doc | When |
|-----|------|
| [docs/PLATFORM.md](../docs/PLATFORM.md) | Architecture, routes, env |
| [docs/THERMAL-MISSION-CONTROL.md](../docs/THERMAL-MISSION-CONTROL.md) | Heat → clip → Stripe → bounty |
| [docs/CURSOR-PRIMARY.md](../docs/CURSOR-PRIMARY.md) | Cursor setup (MCP, cloud vs local) |
| [docs/AI-APPLICATION-CARD-BLUEPRINT.md](../docs/AI-APPLICATION-CARD-BLUEPRINT.md) | AI Application Card blueprint |
